  <data key="d0">Financial Table Navigation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Financial table navigation is a case study demonstrating how RAG-Anything transforms financial report tables into structured graphs for precise metric extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial table navigation is a case addressing the challenge of extracting specific metrics from tables with similar terminology and multiple time periods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17a576920c675eca791231767d46477b</data>
