<node id="Visual-Layout Graph">
  <data key="d0">Visual-Layout Graph</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A visual-layout graph is a graph structure built by RAG-Anything where panels, axis titles, legends, and captions become nodes connected by semantic edges.&lt;SEP&gt;A visual-layout graph constructed by RAG-Anything where panels, axis titles, legends, and captions become nodes with edges encoding semantic relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;A visual-layout graph is constructed by RAG-Anything where panels, axis titles, legends, and captions become nodes with edges encoding semantic relationships.</data>
