</node>
<node id="Structure-Aware Retrieval">
  <data key="d0">Structure-Aware Retrieval</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Structure-aware retrieval mechanisms enable RAG-Anything to navigate multi-panel visualizations and disambiguate similar terminology.&lt;SEP&gt;Structure-aware retrieval is a design approach of RAG-Anything that transforms documents into explicit graph representations capturing intra-modal relationships.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dded67fd8182de2201aa35ccbb4c8cd9</data>
