  <data key="d2">Wages and salaries is a row in a financial report table used as a case study for precise cell navigation, with the target cell being 26,778 million for 2020.&lt;SEP&gt;Wages and salaries is a row in the financial table that the retriever focuses on during navigation.&lt;SEP&gt;Wages and salaries is a row in the financial evidence table containing values of 26,778 (2020), 25,335 (2019), and 25,259 (2018) DKK million.</data>
