<node id="Figure 3">
  <data key="d0">Figure 3</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 3 shows a challenging t-SNE visualization with multiple subpanels used in the multi-panel figure interpretation case study.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 3 shows a challenging t-SNE visualization with multiple subpanels, requiring distinction between two related but distinct panels.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 3 shows a challenging t-SNE visualization with multiple subpanels requiring distinction between two related but distinct panels.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 3 is the figure referenced in the question, which depicts the sequence followed to generate the final labels for Named Entity Recognition.</data>
