<node id="Cross-Modal Reranking">
  <data key="d0">Cross-Modal Reranking</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Cross-modal reranking is a component of RAG-Anything that provides valuable refinement, though primary gains stem from graph-based retrieval and cross-modal integration.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-modal reranking is a component of RAG-Anything that is removed in the W/o Reranker variant and provides additional performance gains.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de93d4b6f02e5ae737b9b9e8142401cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f9c375189978b339552ff8ff4ba819</data>
