</node>
<node id="GCAN">
  <data key="d0">GCAN</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">GCAN is a model with submodel components whose removal affects accuracy on the Twitter15 dataset, referenced in a visual reasoning query.&lt;SEP&gt;GCAN is a model with sub-model components whose removal affects accuracy, evaluated on Twitter15 and Twitter16 datasets.&lt;SEP&gt;GCAN is a model with submodel components whose removal affects accuracy on the Twitter15 dataset.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7aefd567d430c404aab77872282400eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-306f65a0f4295fa49788ecf8659d4b81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89ff37f1683bc8edc5276effd3646dee</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
