</node>
<node id="Evidence Inference Dataset">
  <data key="d0">Evidence Inference Dataset</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The Evidence Inference dataset is a dataset with repeated row labels across multiple datasets within the same table, used to evaluate model combinations by AUPRC value.&lt;SEP&gt;The Evidence Inference dataset is a dataset for which model combinations are evaluated by AUPRC value.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7aefd567d430c404aab77872282400eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89ff37f1683bc8edc5276effd3646dee</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
