<node id="Multimodal Document Question Answering">
  <data key="d0">Multimodal Document Question Answering</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Multimodal Document Question Answering is a task involving answering questions based on multimodal documents, evaluated using DocBench and MMLongBench.&lt;SEP&gt;Multimodal Document Question Answering is the task domain of the DocBench and MMLongBench benchmarks, involving question answering over multimodal documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2d4727f37ea1b30518f13dc89ffc7ea1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0987c79c221cedef1a930b87f821f</data>
