  <data key="d0">Research Reports</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Research Reports is an information-dense domain on MMLongBench where RAG-Anything achieves the best results.&lt;SEP&gt;Research Reports is an information-dense domain on MMLongBench where RAG-Anything achieves the best results.&lt;SEP&gt;Research Reports is an information-dense domain in which RAG-Anything achieves the best results on MMLongBench.&lt;SEP&gt;Research reports are a document type in MMLongBench with the most documents (34), the most questions (292), and an average length of 39 pages.</data>
