  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Financial Reports is an information-dense domain on MMLongBench where RAG-Anything achieves the best results.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial Reports (Fin.) is a document domain in MMLongBench where RAGAnything achieves the highest accuracy of 43.6%.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial Reports is an information-dense domain on MMLongBench where RAG-Anything achieves the best results.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial Reports is an information-dense domain in which RAG-Anything achieves the best results on MMLongBench.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial reports are a document type in MMLongBench with 11 documents, 117 questions, and the longest average length (87 pages).</data>
