<node id="Retrieval-Augmented Generation">
  <data key="d0">Retrieval-Augmented Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) is a paradigm for dynamically expanding the knowledge boundaries of LLMs by enabling them to retrieve and incorporate external knowledge sources during inference.&lt;SEP&gt;Retrieval-Augmented Generation is a fundamental paradigm for expanding Large Language Models beyond their static training limitations by enabling dynamic retrieval and incorporation of external knowledge during inference.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a43d425aea6f4b6c0edc38f28595f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dded67fd8182de2201aa35ccbb4c8cd9</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514166</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
