  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">NeurIPS is a conference where the HippoRAG work was published.&lt;SEP&gt;NeurIPS is a conference where the Hipporag paper was published.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-76a69463e145e164e890b6c29aba9ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5f0a5a74b5a4eac43772c74649ca651</data>
