  <data key="d0">Context From Surrounding Content</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Context from surrounding content is a section in the prompt followed by a placeholder for the surrounding context.&lt;SEP&gt;Context From Surrounding Content is a placeholder within the equation analysis prompt for providing surrounding content context.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-840e794a234c66ff0680c138d02d19ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d556fb722f8eac5fc92376e70d34e60</data>
