  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A.3 Context-Aware Multimodal Prompting is a section heading in the RAG-Anything document.&lt;SEP&gt;A.3 Context-Aware Multimodal Prompting is a section of the RAG-Anything framework addressing prompting strategies for multimodal contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b4b25ee421d57dc99861b0d26ac02b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89ff37f1683bc8edc5276effd3646dee</data>
