  <data key="d0">A.4 Accuracy Evaluation Prompt Design</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A.4 Accuracy Evaluation Prompt Design is a section of the RAG-Anything framework describing the design of the standardized accuracy evaluation prompt.</data>
