<node id="A.5 Challenges And Future Directions For Multi-Modal RAG">
  <data key="d0">A.5 Challenges And Future Directions For Multi-Modal RAG</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A.5 Challenges and Future Directions for Multi-Modal RAG is a section of the RAG-Anything framework discussing limitations and future directions of multimodal RAG systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b4b25ee421d57dc99861b0d26ac02b54</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514434</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Accuracy Evaluation Prompt Template">
  <data key="d0">Accuracy Evaluation Prompt Template</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accuracy Evaluation Prompt Template is a prompt template titled 'Accuracy Evaluation Prompt' containing a numbered list of instructions and criteria for evaluating the accuracy of answers generated by a RAG system, structured with an introductory role definition, task description, input fields for question, expected answer, and generated answer, evaluation criteria with a binary scoring system, instructions for handling partial matches, numerical answers, list answers, and unanswerable questions, and an output format specification.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b4b25ee421d57dc99861b0d26ac02b54</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514434</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Accuracy Evaluation Prompt Image">
  <data key="d0">Accuracy Evaluation Prompt Image</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accuracy Evaluation Prompt Image is a screenshot of a text editor window displaying the accuracy evaluation prompt template, with a light gray background, a title bar showing the filename 'accuracy_evaluation_prompt.png', macOS window control buttons, and line numbers on the left side.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b4b25ee421d57dc99861b0d26ac02b54</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514434</data>
