  <data key="d0">2020 Column</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The 2020 column is a column in the financial table for the specified year that the retriever focuses on.&lt;SEP&gt;The 2020 column is a column in the financial evidence table containing data cells for the year 2020.</data>
