<node id="Structured Graph">
  <data key="d0">Structured Graph</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A structured graph that RAG-Anything transforms a financial report table into, where each row header, column header, data cell, and unit becomes a node.&lt;SEP&gt;A structured graph is a representation where each row header, column header, data cell, and unit becomes a node with edges capturing relationships like row-of, column-of, header-applies-to, and unit-of.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17a576920c675eca791231767d46477b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3ef854a849174a61602e3f9d4a8eac1</data>
