</node>
<node id="Share-Based Payments">
  <data key="d0">Share-Based Payments</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Share-based payments is a nearby entry in the financial table that the system successfully disambiguates from the target cell.&lt;SEP&gt;Share-based payments is a nearby entry in the financial table that competing methods often confuse with the target row.</data>
