  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Bi-LSTM-CRF model is a neural network architecture shown in the evidence figure, with nodes labeled B-ORG, I-ORG, and O, used for Named Entity Recognition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
