<node id="Evidence Figure">
  <data key="d0">Evidence Figure</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The evidence figure is a diagram within the document containing a vertical list of terms describing the NER label generation sequence, presented from bottom to top.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
