<node id="NER Label Generation Sequence">
  <data key="d0">NER Label Generation Sequence</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The NER label generation sequence is Characters -&gt; Char Embedding -&gt; Char LSTM-B/F -&gt; Word Features -&gt; Word Representation -&gt; Word LSTM-F/B -&gt; Word CRF -&gt; Label, as stated in the expected answer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Figure 11">
  <data key="d0">Figure 11</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 11 is a composite figure illustrating the cross-modal noise case, showing a source document, an evidence table, and incorrect responses from four different methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 11 presents a particularly revealing failure scenario where all evaluated methods consistently produce incorrect answers despite having access to the necessary information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a908e853be8da852064e031c68c78242</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Char Embedding">
  <data key="d0">Char Embedding</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Char Embedding is a step in the NER label generation sequence that converts characters into embeddings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Char LSTM-B">
  <data key="d0">Char LSTM-B</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Char LSTM-B is a backward character-level LSTM layer in the NER label generation sequence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Char LSTM-F">
  <data key="d0">Char LSTM-F</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Char LSTM-F is a forward character-level LSTM layer in the NER label generation sequence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Word Features">
  <data key="d0">Word Features</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Word Features is a step in the NER label generation sequence that provides word-level features.</data>
