  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Word Representation">
  <data key="d0">Word Representation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Word Representation is a step in the NER label generation sequence that produces word representations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Word LSTM-F">
  <data key="d0">Word LSTM-F</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Word LSTM-F is a forward word-level LSTM layer in the NER label generation sequence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Word LSTM-B">
  <data key="d0">Word LSTM-B</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Word LSTM-B is a backward word-level LSTM layer in the NER label generation sequence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Word CRF">
  <data key="d0">Word CRF</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Word CRF is a conditional random field layer that produces the final labels in the NER label generation sequence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514439</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Label">
  <data key="d0">Label</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Label is the final output of the NER label generation sequence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Characters">
  <data key="d0">Characters</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Characters are the initial input of the NER label generation sequence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="B-ORG">
  <data key="d0">B-ORG</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">B-ORG is a node label in the Bi-LSTM-CRF model diagram representing the beginning of an organization entity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="I-ORG">
  <data key="d0">I-ORG</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">I-ORG is a node label in the Bi-LSTM-CRF model diagram representing the inside of an organization entity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="O">
  <data key="d0">O</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">O is a node label in the Bi-LSTM-CRF model diagram representing a non-entity token.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ff528cd8f38cd79fa57c96fab4a7c2</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Knowledge Graph">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge Graph</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Knowledge Graph is a merged graph over all documents that integrates text-based and cross-modal knowledge graphs through entity alignment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Vector Database">
  <data key="d0">Vector Database</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Vector Database stores encoded representations, including a Text VDB and a Multi-modal VDB that are merged into a VDB over all documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parallel Parser">
  <data key="d0">Parallel Parser</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Parallel Parser processes input documents through four parallel processes: hierarchical text extraction, image caption and metadata extraction, LaTeX equation recognition, and table structure and content parsing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Structured Content List">
  <data key="d0">Structured Content List</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The Structured Content List is generated by the Parallel Parser and combines text, image, equation, and table information into textual multimodal info.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Text Encoder">
  <data key="d0">Text Encoder</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Text Encoder processes textual multimodal info to create text and multimodal vector databases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hybrid Retrieved Info">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Retrieved Info</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Hybrid Retrieved Info is the combined output from structural knowledge navigation and semantic similarity matching that is passed to an LLM for response generation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multimodal Processors">
  <data key="d0">Multimodal Processors</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multimodal Processors use VLM/LLM to process textual multimodal info for entity and relation extraction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Atomic Content Units">
  <data key="d0">Atomic Content Units</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Atomic Content Units are the decomposed components of knowledge sources, each consisting of a modality type and corresponding raw content.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Input Documents">
  <data key="d0">Input Documents</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Input Documents are various file formats including PPT, PPTX, DOC, DOCX, JPG, JPEG, PNG, XLS, XLSX, and PDF that are processed by the RAG-Anything framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514440</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Textual Multi-Modal Info">
  <data key="d0">Textual Multi-Modal Info</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Textual Multi-Modal Info is the combined stack of text, image, equation, and table information produced by the Parallel Parser.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Query">
  <data key="d0">Query</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A Query is user input such as 'Could you share insights on the experimental results and data tables?' that initiates the retrieval and generation process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Response">
  <data key="d0">Response</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A Response is the final output generated by the LLM based on hybrid retrieved information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LLM">
  <data key="d0">LLM</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The LLM receives hybrid retrieved info and generates responses to queries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="VLM">
  <data key="d0">VLM</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">VLM is used alongside LLM in multimodal processors for entity and relation extraction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hierarchical Text Extraction">
  <data key="d0">Hierarchical Text Extraction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Hierarchical Text Extraction is a parallel parsing process that produces text info from input documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Image Caption &amp; Metadata Extraction">
  <data key="d0">Image Caption &amp; Metadata Extraction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Image Caption &amp; Metadata Extraction is a parallel parsing process that produces image info from input documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LaTeX Equation Recognition">
  <data key="d0">LaTeX Equation Recognition</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">LaTeX Equation Recognition is a parallel parsing process that produces equation info from input documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Table Structure &amp; Content Parsing">
  <data key="d0">Table Structure &amp; Content Parsing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Table Structure &amp; Content Parsing is a parallel parsing process that produces table info from input documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Text Info Processing">
  <data key="d0">Text Info Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Text Info Processing is a process for entity and relation extraction from text information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Modal Info Processing">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Modal Info Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Multi-Modal Info Processing is a process for entity and relation extraction from multimodal information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Query High-/Low-Level Keys Extraction">
  <data key="d0">Query High-/Low-Level Keys Extraction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Query High-/Low-Level Keys Extraction processes a query to enable both structural knowledge navigation and semantic similarity matching.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="KG over All Documents">
  <data key="d0">KG over All Documents</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">KG over All Documents is the merged knowledge graph containing interconnected nodes of different modalities from all documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="VDB over All Documents">
  <data key="d0">VDB over All Documents</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">VDB over All Documents is the merged vector database containing text and multimodal vector representations from all documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bce">
  <data key="d0">Bce</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bce is a node in the Text-Based Knowledge Graph within the RAG-Anything framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514441</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Beecher">
  <data key="d0">Beecher</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Beecher is a node in the Text-Based Knowledge Graph within the RAG-Anything framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514442</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chemistry">
  <data key="d0">Chemistry</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Chemistry is a node in the Text-Based Knowledge Graph within the RAG-Anything framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514442</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parent Node: Multi-Modal Instance">
  <data key="d0">Parent Node: Multi-Modal Instance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Parent Node: Multi-Modal Instance is a node in the Cross-Modal Knowledge Graph representing a multimodal instance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514442</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Child Node">
  <data key="d0">Child Node</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Child Node is a node in the Cross-Modal Knowledge Graph connected to the parent multimodal instance node.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-808bf767f815e787e09b6b3e8a122b71</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1791514442</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Text VDB">
  <data key="d0">Text VDB</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Text VDB is a vector database containing text representations, created by the Text Encoder.</data>
