<node id="Cross-Modal Noise Case">
  <data key="d0">Cross-Modal Noise Case</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The cross-modal noise case is a failure scenario illustrated in Figure 11 where all methods fail to retrieve the correct answer from a specified image, instead retrieving noisy textual evidence that misaligns with structured visual content.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a908e853be8da852064e031c68c78242</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
