</node>
<node id="Ambiguous Table Structure Case">
  <data key="d0">Ambiguous Table Structure Case</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The ambiguous table structure case is a failure scenario illustrated in Figure 12 where all methods fail to correctly parse a confusing table layout with merged cells and unclear column boundaries, leading to incorrect data extraction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a908e853be8da852064e031c68c78242</data>
  <data key="d4">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
