  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Unified Knowledge Graph" target="Entity Alignment">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Entity alignment merges the multimodal and text-based knowledge graphs to create a unified knowledge graph capturing both contextual and semantic connections.</data>
  <data key="d9">graph fusion,knowledge consolidation</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-eac0008c777dab7291aec281277e77a1</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791514207</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Embedding Table" target="Retrieval Index">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The embedding table together with the unified knowledge graph constitutes the complete retrieval index.&lt;SEP&gt;The Retrieval Index is constituted by the Embedding Table, which provides a dense vector space for efficient similarity search.</data>
  <data key="d9">component composition,dense vector space,index component,retrieval infrastructure</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ea106f7be2831088c0a1118ecb40eee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eac0008c777dab7291aec281277e77a1</data>
  <data key="d11">/Users/drw/PycharmProjects/rag-anything-reproduction/data/RAG-Anything_arXiv_2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1791514182</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Embedding Table" target="Semantic Similarity Matching">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Semantic Similarity Matching conducts dense vector similarity search between the query embedding and all components stored in the Embedding Table.</data>
  <data key="d9">embedding utilization,vector search</data>
