<edge source="Cross-Modal Hybrid Retrieval" target="RAG-Anything">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">RAG-Anything uses a cross-modal hybrid retrieval mechanism combining structural navigation with semantic similarity matching.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything develops cross-modal hybrid retrieval that combines structural knowledge navigation with semantic matching.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything employs cross-modal hybrid retrieval as a core mechanism effective for long-document reasoning.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything employs cross-modal hybrid retrieval as part of its framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The effectiveness of cross-modal hybrid retrieval mechanisms is validated by the ablation study results.</data>
