<edge source="RAG-Anything" target="Cross-Modal Knowledge Graph">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">RAG-Anything constructs a cross-modal knowledge graph that grounds non-textual modalities within their contextual environment.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything constructs the cross-modal knowledge graph using a dual-graph construction strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Anything constructs the cross-modal knowledge graph whose edge set is defined by Equation (4).</data>
