<edge source="DocBench" target="MMLongBench">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">DocBench and MMLongBench together provide comprehensive coverage of multimodal document understanding challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;DocBench and MMLongBench are compared in Table 1, with DocBench emphasizing document depth and MMLongBench emphasizing document type breadth.&lt;SEP&gt;DocBench and MMLongBench are both benchmarks with detailed dataset statistics provided in Tables 5 and 6 respectively.&lt;SEP&gt;DocBench and MMLongBench collectively provide comprehensive coverage for multimodal document understanding evaluation.</data>
