<edge source="Large Language Models" target="Graph-Enhanced Retrieval-Augmented Generation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Graph-enhanced retrieval-augmented generation addresses large language models' limitations with long-context inputs and multi-hop queries through explicit relational modeling.</data>
  <data key="d9">problem solving,relational modeling</data>
