</edge>
<edge source="Large Language Models" target="Retrieval-Augmented Generation">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">RAG enables LLMs to retrieve and incorporate external knowledge sources during inference, transforming them into adaptive knowledge-aware systems.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG expands the knowledge boundaries of Large Language Models beyond their static training limitations.</data>
  <data key="d9">inference,knowledge augmentation,knowledge expansion,paradigm</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-a43d425aea6f4b6c0edc38f28595f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dded67fd8182de2201aa35ccbb4c8cd9</data>
