<edge source="Equation Analysis Prompt" target="Context-Aware Multimodal Prompting">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Context-Aware Multimodal Prompting includes the Equation Analysis Prompt as one of its three structured prompts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Equation Analysis Prompt prioritizes semantic interpretation of mathematical expressions within the context-aware multimodal prompting approach.&lt;SEP&gt;The equation analysis prompt is part of the context-aware multimodal prompting methodology.</data>
