<edge source="Text-Centric Retrieval Bias" target="Multimodal RAG">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Text-Centric Retrieval Bias is a critical failure pattern in multimodal RAG systems revealing inadequate cross-modal attention.</data>
