<edge source="Text-Centric Retrieval Bias" target="Multimodal Retrieval-Augmented Generation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Multimodal RAG systems exhibit text-centric retrieval bias, preferentially accessing textual sources even when queries require visual information.</data>
  <data key="d9">limitation,retrieval bias</data>
