  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Text-Centric Retrieval Bias" target="Multimodal RAG Systems">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Text-centric retrieval bias reveals a fundamental weakness in cross-modal attention mechanisms of multimodal RAG systems.</data>
  <data key="d9">cross-modal attention,systemic weakness</data>
