<edge source="Cross-Modal Knowledge Graph" target="Text-Based Knowledge Graph">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The cross-modal and text-based knowledge graphs are merged through entity alignment to create a unified representation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cross-Modal Knowledge Graph and Text-Based Knowledge Graph are merged through entity alignment.&lt;SEP&gt;The cross-modal knowledge graph is fused with the text-based knowledge graph through entity alignment.&lt;SEP&gt;The cross-modal knowledge graph is later merged with a text-based knowledge graph through entity alignment.&lt;SEP&gt;The cross-modal knowledge graph and the text-based knowledge graph are fused via entity alignment.</data>
