  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Entity alignment merges the multimodal knowledge graph with the text-based knowledge graph using entity names as matching keys.&lt;SEP&gt;The cross-modal knowledge graph is fused with the text-based knowledge graph through entity alignment.</data>
  <data key="d9">entity matching,fusion process,graph fusion,knowledge integration</data>
